mon غلط است."}]},{"type":"produce","id":"p1","prompt":"این یک اشتباه رایج است.","frame":"This is a ___ mistake.","answer":"common","accept":[],"why":"a common mistake."}]}],"version":"aea6bb755c35","order":407,"released":false},{"id":"lex:A1:correct","headword":"correct","goals":["everyday","work","study","general"],"senses":[{"id":"lex:A1:correct","pos":"adjective","gloss":"درست؛ صحیح","meaning":"بدون اشتباه؛ مطابق واقعیت. ضدش wrong یا incorrect. کمی رسمی‌تر از right. «درست می‌گویی» You're right است.","grammar":[{"pattern":"be correct","note":"Your answer is correct."},{"pattern":"the correct + noun","note":"the correct answer"},{"pattern":"That's correct.","note":"درست است."}],"examples":[{"en":"Is this the correct address?","fa":"این آدرس درست است؟"},{"en":"All your answers are correct. Well done!","fa":"همهٔ جواب‌هایت درست است. آفرین!"}],"collocations":["the correct answer","correct spelling","that's correct","completely correct"],"mistake":{"wrong":"You say correct.","right":"You're right. / That's correct.","why":"«درست می‌گویی» در انگلیسی You're right است."},"pronunciation":{"gb":"/kəˈrekt/","us":"/kəˈrekt/","note":"تکیه روی بخش دوم است: «کِرِکت»."},"check":[{"type":"cloze","id":"c1","text":"Choose the ___ answer: a, b or c.","answer":"correct","accept":["right"],"fa":"جواب درست را انتخاب کن: الف، ب یا ج.","why":"the correct answer."},{"type":"choice","id":"q1","prompt":"Is this the ___ way to the station?","options":[{"text":"correct","ok":true,"why":"صفت قبل از اسم."},{"text":"correctly","ok":false,"why":"correctly قید است."},{"text":"correction","ok":false,"why":"correction اسم است."}]},{"type":"produce","id":"p1","prompt":"جواب تو درست است.","frame":"Your answer is ___.","answer":"correct","accept":["right"],"why":"correct = درست."}]},{"id":"lex:A1:correct#verb","pos":"verb","gloss":"تصحیح کردن","meaning":"اشتباه‌ها را پیدا و درست کردن؛ مثلاً معلم برگه‌ها را تصحیح می‌کند. برای تعمیر وسیله fix می‌گوییم، نه correct.","grammar":[{"pattern":"correct + noun","note":"correct mistakes"},{"pattern":"correct + person","note":"Please correct me."},{"pattern":"corrected","note":"گذشته"}],"examples":[{"en":"The teacher corrects our homework every day.","fa":"معلم هر روز تکالیف ما را تصحیح می‌کند."},{"en":"Please correct me if I make a mistake.","fa":"لطفاً اگر اشتباه کردم، درستم کن."}],"collocations":["correct mistakes","correct homework","correct me","correct a test"],"mistake":{"wrong":"Can you correct my bike?","right":"Can you fix my bike?","why":"correct برای اشتباه‌های نوشتن و گفتن است؛ برای تعمیر وسیله fix می‌گوییم."},"pronunciation":{"gb":"/kəˈrekt/","us":"/kəˈrekt/"},"check":[{"type":"cloze","id":"c1","text":"Read your story again and ___ the mistakes.","answer":"correct","accept":[],"fa":"داستانت را دوباره بخوان و اشتباه‌ها را درست کن.","why":"correct mistakes."},{"type":"choice","id":"q1","prompt":"My teacher always ___ my spelling.","options":[{"text":"corrects","ok":true,"why":"سوم شخص مفرد s می‌گیرد."},{"text":"correct","ok":false,"why":"با my teacher فعل s می‌گیرد."},{"text":"correction","ok":false,"why":"correction اسم است."}]},{"type":"produce","id":"h1","prompt":"لطفاً اشتباه‌هایم را تصحیح کن.","frame":"Please ___ my mistakes.","answer":"correct","accept":[],"why":"correct mistakes = اشتباه‌ها را تصحیح کردن."}]}],"version":"89ceea1b48c3","order":408,"released":false},{"id":"lex:A1:dangerous","headword":"dangerous","goals":["everyday","general"],"senses":[{"id":"lex:A1:dangerous","pos":"adjective","gloss":"خطرناک","meaning":"چیزی که می‌تواند آسیب بزند. ضدش safe. It's dangerous to + فعل = … خطرناک است.","grammar":[{"pattern":"be dangerous","note":"This road is dangerous."},{"pattern":"It's dangerous to + verb","note":"… خطرناک است"},{"pattern":"a dangerous + noun","note":"a dangerous animal"}],"examples":[{"en":"It's dangerous to swim here.","fa":"شنا کردن اینجا خطرناک است."},{"en":"Some snakes are very dangerous.","fa":"بعضی مارها خیلی خطرناک‌اند."}],"collocations":["very dangerous","a dangerous road","a danger